WEBVTT

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.741
neutrinos,

00:02:30.765 --> 00:02:35.160
the conversion of mass
to energy -- that's E=mc2 --

00:02:35.184 --> 00:02:36.420
gamma rays,

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.342
transmutation.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:45.976
That ancient dream that had
always eluded the alchemists

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.254
was achieved through these same theories

00:02:48.278 --> 00:02:52.976
that explained starlight
and other ancient mysteries

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.348
and new, unexpected phenomena.

00:02:56.372 --> 00:03:00.345
That all that, discovered in 40 years,